    ('PP-ASEL-0092', 'Private, Commercial, Flight Instructor', 'ASEL', 'PA.I.A; CA.I.A; FI.II.J', 'What is required reporting for aircraft accidents and incidents?', null, '14 CFR parts 61 and 91; AIM; FAA-H-8083-25', 'I. Preflight Preparation; II. Technical Subject Areas', 'PA.I.A Pilot Qualifications / Regulatory Responsibilities; CA.I.A Pilot Qualifications / Regulatory Responsibilities; FI.II.J 14 CFR and Publications', 'knowledge', 'standard'),
